BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tørrlagt januar (Dry January)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260201
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-dry-january-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Dry January\n\nInternational campaign month\, widely picked up
  in Norway. No Norwegian owner. Remember that alcohol advertising is banne
 d in Norway (alkoholloven § 9-2)\; alcohol-free variants need care not to
  promote the parent brand.\n\nSource: https://alcoholchange.org.uk/get-inv
 olved/campaigns/dry-january
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://alcoholchange.org.uk/get-involved/campaigns/dry-january
END:VEVENT
