DESCRIPTION:Mother's Day (Norway)\n\nSecond Sunday in FEBRUARY in Norway (
 not May as in the US/most of Europe). Flowers\, chocolate\, breakfast-in-b
 ed. International brands regularly get this wrong.\n\nSource: https://snl.
 no/morsdag
