 e local skolerute.\n\nEaster school break\n\nSchools close from the Monday
  before skjærtorsdag through 2. påskedag\; some kommuner add the Tuesday
 . Range shown: Saturday before palmesøndag to Easter Tuesday. Peak cabin 
 and mountain season.\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06
 -09-30
