BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fellesferie
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260706
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260725
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-fellesferie-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Collective summer holiday\n\nTraditionally ISO weeks 28–30 i
 n July\, recommended by NHO and Fellesforbundet for industry (6–24 July 
 in 2026). Ferieloven § 5 lets employees claim 3 weeks' main holiday betwe
 en 1 June and 30 September (https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/1988-04-29-
 21). B2B goes quiet\; travel\, grilling and cabin peak.\n\nSource: https:/
 /www.thelocal.no/20210702/fellesferie-everything-you-need-to-know-about-no
 rways-collective-holiday-period
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.thelocal.no/20210702/fellesferie-everything-you-need-to-kn
 ow-about-norways-collective-holiday-period
END:VEVENT
