DESCRIPTION:Dates vary by kommune — this is the national range. Check th
 e local skolerute.\n\nChristmas school break\n\nSet locally\; typically fr
 om the weekend before Christmas to the first working days of January (Oslo
 : 21 Dec 2026 – 1 Jan 2027\; 20 Dec 2027 – 3 Jan 2028). Shown as ~19 D
 ec – ~3 Jan.\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
